  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. AWS Sign-In manages authentication for AWS services. This service provides secure authentication flows for accessing AWS resources from the console and developer tools. This release adds the CreateOAuth2Token API, which can be used to fetch OAuth2 access tokens and refresh tokens from Sign-In.",
